  /* The track is the demo. Its dot is driven ONLY by the token on the element, so the row cannot print one duration and animate another the way the old hardcoded-px bars could. */
  /* container-type is what makes cqw resolve against the TRACK rather than the viewport — without it the dot would travel a fraction of the window instead of its own lane. */
